From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruiyangke <me@ry.ke>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gpui_windows: Keep the client size across DPI changes

Windows scales a whole window for a new DPI, native frame included, so the
client drifts from its logical size: a native-frame window at 150 % ended a
couple of points small. Answer WM_GETDPISCALEDSIZE with the client scaled
exactly plus the frame measured at the new DPI, without the caption of a
window that hides its title bar. Windows may place a window again at the
size it would have scaled it to; keep the answer then.

Remove when upstream gpui_windows handles WM_GETDPISCALEDSIZE.
---
 crates/gpui_windows/src/events.rs        |  79 ++++++++++++
 crates/gpui_windows/src/native_resize.rs | 148 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 crates/gpui_windows/src/window.rs        |   2 +
 3 files changed, 229 insertions(+)

